## Common Code Patterns

### New route handler
```typescript
router.post('/', zValidator('json', CreateSchema), async (c) => {
  const siteId = c.get('siteId')
  const body = c.req.valid('json')
  const result = await myService.create(c, siteId, body)
  return c.json({ data: result }, 201)
})
```

### New DB table
```typescript
export const myTable = pgTable('my_table', {
  id:        text('id').primaryKey(),         // nanoid()
  siteId:    text('site_id').notNull(),       // REQUIRED
  name:      text('name').notNull(),
  createdAt: timestamp('created_at', { withTimezone: true }).defaultNow().notNull(),
  updatedAt: timestamp('updated_at', { withTimezone: true }).defaultNow().notNull(),
})
```

### Cache write with tags
```typescript
const runtime = c.get('runtime')
await runtime.cache.set(`schema:${siteId}`, JSON.stringify(schema), {
  tags: [`schema:${siteId}`],
  ttl: 60,
})
```

### Deprecate an endpoint (only when retiring it)
```typescript
import { withDeprecation } from '../middleware/deprecation'

// Mount on the retiring router/route ONLY — do not add to the global chain
legacyRouter.use('*', withDeprecation({
  since: '2026-08-01',
  sunset: '2026-11-01',
  link: 'https://docs.lumibase.dev/changelog#items-legacy',
}))
```
Emits `Deprecation` / optional `Sunset` / optional `Link rel="deprecation"`. Options are all optional (`Deprecation: true` if no `since`). See `docs/en/agent-setup/prompt.md` and OWASP API9 in `docs/en/security/owasp-api-top-10-audit.md`.
